Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:33.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What was that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:45.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:47.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.62,0:00:50.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:51.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:55.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:59.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll talk to them next Monday, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:03.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:11.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My grandpa from my mother's side passed away last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:19.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That dream just now, it was about Grandpa and... my mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:30.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1800,0)}My relatives and I seemed to have grown distant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:56.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while since I've been here, and now I'm here but for a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:32.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.35,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh, it's Daiki-chan. You're pretty early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.56,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Go put your baggage in Grandpa's bedroom. {Use belongings if it's too literal}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:38.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:41.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}There's a little girl in the garden.{Removed "small", was redundant. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Since when did Haruko's kid look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That isn't Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then whose kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:55.52,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez... I can't seem to get used to this kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:04.88,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,How are we going to deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:07.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At the age of 79, he's lived long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:11.61,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,That girl seems to be your grandpa's illegitimate child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:12.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,WHAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:15.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:19.30,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't tell me anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.33,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,That lover of his isn't even here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:23.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Lover?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:25.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He's already 79 years old, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:29.12,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,What a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:32.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That means, she's your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which also makes her my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.85,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,How can you still pull a joke like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:42.39,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,You're already in your thirties, don't say things without thinking! {Think before you talk}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:11.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1560)}Rest in peace, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.99,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,How much should I give?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:37.57,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,It's the thought that counts; how much you give doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:41.07,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,That may be true, but there must be a rough estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:43.67,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Any amount is fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:49.63,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,But nowadays, the practice is to peg the sum according to both the ritual and posthumous name...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:55.47,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,It should be around forty to fifty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:58.41,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That isn't cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:00.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.61,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:05.65,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Were you busy all this while?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:09.90,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Busy as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:11.53,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know Mum's always thinking of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:14.88,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even come home during the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:16.62,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.74,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:25.88,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.47,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Dai-chan, haven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.47,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Mama~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.84,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:34.34,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Now I've caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:37.55,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, a good kid must always be obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:39.31,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.31,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:40.56,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:48.47,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You really have grown to resemble your grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:57.39,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you must have heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:59.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my mum told me about it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:01.53,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:05.84,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I understand it gets really lonely living by yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:10.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,There seems to be an MCH Handbook; I think her name is Rin. {MCH Handbook = Maternal and Child Health Handbook (boshi techo), it is a handbook given when a mother registers her pregnancy in Japan}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:10.13,Note,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Note: MCH Handbook = Maternal and Child Health Handbook (boshi techo). It is a handbook given to a mother when she registers her pregnancy in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:14.09,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,But, speaking of which, doing such a thing when he's already 79.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it'd be an exception if Dad was the one who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:20.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But for it to happen to Grandpa, somehow I feel he did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:24.84,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, help me bring out the cushions from the cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.15,0:09:21.09,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, exchange with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.23,0:09:26.25,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do that, just give it to me that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.30,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:37.45,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.43,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, I told you to stop running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:42.10,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.17,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's beautiful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.10,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:47.60,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan is really good at the Cat's Cradle. {Note: 綾取り Ayatori is a game of manipulating rubber bands or elastic strings http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ayatori}{http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat%27s_cradle}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:52.56,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Why not do a "4-step-ladder" next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:58.49,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my. Reina-chan, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:00.61,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Poo bomb!{unko bakudan}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:02.33,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:53.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle. Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:55.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should go and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:57.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll keep watch on the incense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.92,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:04.51,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't sleep here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.86,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go inside and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:09.80,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What about the incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:12.84,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi said he will keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:15.02,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:18.48,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:23.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:28.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should also sleep inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:31.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:35.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You look horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:12:04.45,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(2000,0)}Well then everyone, let's bid our final farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:11.44,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ask my mum how she's doing. {This 3 lines are murmurings which can be excluded}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:12.97,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:14.25,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:20.22,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.72,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:26.21,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Say goodbye to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.74,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:36.15,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Flowers~!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:38.13,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:43.11,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No! I want to make a flower garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:45.91,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:56.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should come over and say goodbye too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:19.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Place this beside Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:31.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.94,0:13:48.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Bellflower... {竜胆 (リンドウ)rindou = Gentian/Bellflower, Rin's name comes from the flower}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:52.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,...Grandpa's favourite flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:15.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa likes this flower the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:22.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Won't he wake up any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:31.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, he won't even wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:47.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You must really be Grandpa's daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:09.86,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Where did this Yoshii Masako go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:12.72,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Someone who abandoned her child and ran away;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:16.01,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt anything will happen even if we manage to locate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:18.83,Default,Auntie,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, how irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:22.79,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}He's seriously very stubborn. {Avid, please rephrase the two lines. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:44.90,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,You know, that girl, she's unable to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:48.36,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What a bother, her teeth haven't even dropped off yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:51.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She knows how to talk, what's bothersome about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:57.74,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No, she can't. That's why I'm so bored now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:02.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, take them all and play somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:06.29,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like a candy shop, wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.34,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Let's not talk that far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:14.34,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,For now, who's going to look after that child?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:17.51,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,I have to tend to my shop, so we can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:21.45,Default,Auntie,0000,0000,0000,,If only she's more normal, it'd be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:24.16,Default,Auntie,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't seem to be able to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:27.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mum, you've nothing better to do at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:30.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why not let her stay there for the time being?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:35.78,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,T-That's impossible. I'm not as free as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:40.24,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, do you know just how tough it is to raise a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:44.59,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know, up till now, how many sacrifices I've made to raise both of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:48.04,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Also, if you don't do it well, she'll be the one who ends up suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:53.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I thought everyone is discussing on who will look after Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:58.43,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you don't intend to lend a hand anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:00.31,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's face it, this is reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:06.31,Default,Auntie,0000,0000,0000,,We also can't confirm whether she's really Grandpa's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:11.09,Default,Auntie,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(3000,0)}Look, you can't even argue, because you don't think about what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.59,0:18:50.10,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, let's find some place where she will be accepted immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:58.78,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:11.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna come to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.36,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:30.52,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:20.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:23.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:25.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:31.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how you see it, you're my Aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:09.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Does it taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:10.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:16.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You want another bowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.05,0:22:17.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:19.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't any more side dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.52,0:22:21.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can make them into rice balls. {Onigiri}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:24.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There are also no matching ingredients for the rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:26.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:27.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.97,0:22:33.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that's still very hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:34.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:39.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it has a warm taste when you eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:42.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:45.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's wrong. Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:48.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even Daikichi sounds weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.59,0:22:55.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious.
