Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:44.15,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,ashita no koto ha wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:44.15,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,明日のことは　分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:44.15,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's going to happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:49.30,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,korette gisei toha chigau nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:49.30,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,これって　犠牲とは違う　何かが違う
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:49.30,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,This is different from sacrificing, very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:53.01,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,batsugeemu jaa nante omou wa nai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:53.01,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,罰ゲームじゃあ　なんて思うわない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:53.01,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think this is a punishment game either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:56.19,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,tte nande nanoka ha wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:56.19,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,って　なんでなのかは　分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:56.19,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really say well what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:59.42,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:59.42,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,ちょっと　釈然としないけど　
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:59.42,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I do feel quite troubled,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:05.59,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nantemonjanai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:05.59,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,キミの存在　今大事だ　なんてもんじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:05.59,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,but "important" cannot be used to describe your existence any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:11.76,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,owaranai koto nante konoyo no dokonimonai
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:11.76,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,終わらないことなんて　この世のどこにもない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:11.76,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing that will last forever without coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:15.94,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,naku no ha tsurai janai no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:15.94,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,泣くのは辛いじゃないの　
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:15.94,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Crying is a very painful thing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:18.59,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Sweet drops! Sweet drops!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:22.07,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,zutto yume mite itaine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:22.07,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,ずっと　夢見ていたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:22.07,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I have always wanted to dream
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:25.37,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,motto yasashiku shitaine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:25.37,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もっと　優しくしたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:25.37,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,To be able to be more gentle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:28.91,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kimi to iraretara happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:28.91,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,キミと居られたら　happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:28.91,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Just being together with you is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:32.34,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,onnanoko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:32.34,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,女の子って　強いね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:32.34,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:35.65,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,dakedo tokitoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:35.65,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,だけど　ときとき　弱いね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:35.65,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,but at times, they are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:42.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,bokura no negai ha happy! happy! happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:42.23,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,僕らの願いは　happy! happy! happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:42.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Our wish is to be happy! Happy! Happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:46.21,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,sonna hibi mo happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:46.21,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,そんな日々も happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:46.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Such happy days!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:53.43,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,Just wanna make you happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:46.27,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,nichiyou no hare ta hiru sagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:46.27,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,日曜の晴れた昼さがり
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:46.27,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,On a clear Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:49.58,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kyou ha doko he yukou
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:49.58,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,今日はどこへ行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:49.58,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we heading today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:21:00.81,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:21:00.81,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,通い慣れたいつもの道が眩しく輝いて見える
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:21:00.81,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,The usual road that we always take seems to be shining radiantly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:10.98,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,terasu atatakai taiyou to tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:10.98,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,照らす暖かい太陽と　隣に君がいれば　
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:10.98,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,The warm sun shining with you still by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:15.54,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:15.54,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もう　High　High　High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:15.54,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,We're already high, high high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:21.30,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:21.30,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,はしゃぎだす気持ちに
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:21.30,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Feeling merry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:26.19,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:26.19,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,歌え　Life　Life　Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:26.19,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Sing life, life, life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:31.60,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,koe ha dokomade mo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:31.60,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,声はどこまでも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:31.60,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,I can hear our voices anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:36.64,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:36.64,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もう　High　High　High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:36.64,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,We're already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:42.11,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:42.11,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,舞い上がる風に乗り
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:42.11,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Riding on the soaring wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:47.03,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:47.03,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,歌え　Life　Life　Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:47.03,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Sing life, life, life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:55.62,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:55.62,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,声も飛び跳ねる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:55.62,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Our voices are hopping too
